00:46:48.250 --> 00:47:00.760
<v Tana>And he was like, oh, give it to me. I'm going to give it to my girlfriend. It will look better on her, because due to years of yoga, she has curves and muscles that are in separate places than you do.

00:47:00.760 --> 00:47:03.080
