00:52:04.360 --> 00:52:30.650
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>The young woman was Kristen, the NYU student who Don spotted at the protest, Terminator-like, while Deanna watched. Now, Kristen was full of urgency, and she was ready to fight.

00:52:30.650 --> 00:52:33.440
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Act 6, "Kristen."

00:52:33.440 --> 00:52:51.690
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Kristen was 13 and she got a note. Well, she never actually saw the note, even though it was apparently written to her. It was intercepted by a teacher. But she knew what it said, because everyone in school knew. It was from the boys lacrosse team. Dear Kristen, you have nice boobs. You should use them.

00:52:51.690 --> 00:52:57.050
